This product features an independent, modernized architecture heavily inspired by
the design paradigms, wire formats, and public interfaces of Google's LevelDB
(https://github.com/google/leveldb).

All core components—including data serialization, filter pipelines, and environment
abstractions—have been implemented from scratch under the Apache License 2.0.
Where structural layouts or standard utility interfaces (such as Slice and Status designs)
parallel LevelDB for compatibility and architectural consistency, the underlying logic
has been entirely rewritten to leverage modern performance patterns (e.g., hardware
intrinsics, optimized loop unrolling, and devirtualized filter execution).
